TABLE.COMMENT:
Append-only event journal that drives the SSE stream. Same
                    shape as local_sentientia_live_events but with boardid in
                    place of sessionid — per ADR-014 we reuse the pattern,
                    not the table.
                    Event types:
                      leaderboard.recomputed         — payload: {boardid, recomputed_at}
                      leaderboard.score_changed      — payload: {userid, points_now}
                      leaderboard.position_changed   — payload: {userid, old_rank, new_rank}
                    Retention: a daily cron purges events older than 7d.
